# The images are built from what is listed here and nothing else, so the
# rest of the checkout (keys in .envrc, search data, node_modules) never
# reaches a build.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!docker
!search/symbols.toml
!search/glossary
!search/exporter
# Within those, never what a build or a test left behind.
**/target
**/.lake
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.so
